  "ingredients": [
    "2 medium zucchini",
    "2 tablespoon olive oil",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil (for frying)",
    "1/2 medium yellow onion (diced)",
    "2 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "12 ounce ground beef",
    "1/2 teaspoon chili powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon cumin",
    "1/4 teaspoon paprika",
    "1/2 cup fresh tomatoes (diced)",
    "1 cup cheddar cheese (shredded)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients. Preheat oven to 350F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-zucchini-burrito-boats/#wprm-recipe-53669-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Zucchini-Burrito-Boats-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice the zucchinis lengthwise and scoop out the seeds (plus a little extra) to form a boat for the filling to go in. Set extra zucchini aside to add to the filling.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-zucchini-burrito-boats/#wprm-recipe-53669-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Zucchini-Burrito-Boats-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put the zucchini, skin side down, in a baking dish. Drizzle with olive oil.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-zucchini-burrito-boats/#wprm-recipe-53669-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Zucchini-Burrito-Boats-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle with salt and pepper to taste. Bake for 10 minutes or until zucchini starts to soften.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-zucchini-burrito-boats/#wprm-recipe-53669-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Zucchini-Burrito-Boats-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the zucchini is baking, add olive oil, onion, garlic, and zucchini that was scooped out into a frying pan over medium heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-zucchini-burrito-boats/#wprm-recipe-53669-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Zucchini-Burrito-Boats-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry for about 5 minutes, or until onion and zucchini are soft.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-zucchini-burrito-boats/#wprm-recipe-53669-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Zucchini-Burrito-Boats-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the ground beef and saute until beef is browned and cooked through.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-zucchini-burrito-boats/#wprm-recipe-53669-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Zucchini-Burrito-Boats-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the beef is cooked, stir in the chili powder, cumin, paprika, and tomatoes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-zucchini-burrito-boats/#wprm-recipe-53669-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Zucchini-Burrito-Boats-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon the mixture into the zucchini boats.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-zucchini-burrito-boats/#wprm-recipe-53669-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Zucchini-Burrito-Boats-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle with shredded cheese, then put back in the oven for 15 minutes or until cheese is melted.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-zucchini-burrito-boats/#wprm-recipe-53669-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Zucchini-Burrito-Boats-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-zucchini-burrito-boats/#wprm-recipe-53669-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
